@prefix is: <http://infiniq.co.kr/2026/industry_safety#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .



is:안전보건교육 a owl:Class .
is:사업장 a owl:Class .

is:has작업장 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:사업장 ;
    rdfs:range is:작업장 .

is:작업환경측정검사 a owl:Class .
is:작업환경측정검사결과 a owl:Class .
is:유해인자 a owl:Class .

is:has인자 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:작업장 ;
    rdfs:range is:유해인자 .
is:작업환경측정검사를수행하다 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:작업장 ;
    rdfs:range is:작업환경측정검사 .
is:has작업환경측정검사결과 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:작업환경측정검사 ;
    rdfs:range is:작업환경측정검사결과 .
is:has측정일 a owl:DataProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:작업환경측정검사결과 ;
    rdfs:range xsd:date .

